# URL patterns excluded from the scheduled docs link check (lychee).
# One regex per line. Keep this list short: only known-flaky or
# bot-hostile domains, and links that are not meant to resolve.

# DOI resolver frequently rate-limits / 403s automated clients
https://doi.org/.*

# Badge services are rate-limited and irrelevant to docs health
https://img.shields.io/.*
https://static.pepy.tech/.*
https://pepy.tech/.*
https://codecov.io/.*

# Tutorial examples reference local servers (e.g. MLflow UI)
http://localhost.*
https://localhost.*
